Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.53,0:01:40.45,Scr,,0,0,0,,{\fad(420,420)\fnFZLanTingYuan-DB-GBK\bord1.8\fs24\c&HFFFFFF&\3c&H000000&\pos(640,630)}作品内登场的地点·费用·名称等可能与实际不同。
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.16,0:03:09.38,Scr,,0,0,0,,{\fs40\frz17.44\c&H252321&\pos(356.191,36.724)}铃森千花
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.16,0:03:09.38,Scr,,0,0,0,,{\fnFZLanTingHei-R-GBK\fs28\frz17.44\c&H444242&\pos(361.948,104.787)}在画漫画
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.16,0:03:09.38,Scr,,0,0,0,,{\fnFZLanTingHei-R-GBK\fs28\c&H444242&\frz18.87\pos(688.526,255.365)}带着三份分镜稿去协商却全被否决真是太好笑了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.16,0:03:09.38,Scr,,0,0,0,,{\fnFZLanTingHei-R-GBK\fs28\c&H444242&\frz18.87\pos(716.259,414.298)}去协商了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.16,0:03:09.38,Scr,,0,0,0,,{\fnFZLanTingHei-R-GBK\fs28\c&H444242&\frz18.87\pos(628.793,627.631)}啊好困
